/** Multi-Agent Shift Phase 1. Emitted when an agent produces a reasoning trace (typically pre-tool-call, pre-decision, or pre-handoff). The reasoning text MAY be a summary or full trace depending on the run's resolved `RunOptions.configurable.reasoningVerbosity`. Replay-deterministic over the event log. */
